WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.840
Our final section is on temperature-related illness, focusing on what happens when the

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.220
body can no longer regulate its own heat in extreme environments.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.840
In the upcoming slides, we'll cover how to identify and treat emergencies at both

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:22.040
ends of the scale, from life-threatening heat stroke to the dangers of freezing and hypothermia.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.500
Because these conditions can escalate rapidly, knowing the early warning signs is your most

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.820
important tool as an everyday hero.

